flowchart TD
    SQ["search q"] --> OUT{Outcome?}
    OUT -->|Success non-empty| RES["Results"]
    OUT -->|Success empty| EMPTY["Empty"]
    OUT -->|Failure| AE{AppError}
    AE -->|NoConnectivity/Timeout/5xx| ERT["Error retryable=true"]
    AE -->|Serialization/Forbidden| ERF["Error retryable=false"]
    AE -->|RateLimited| BACK["Backoff then retryable"]
    AE -->|Unauthorized| REF["Refresh token, replay"]
    ERT -->|user/auto| SQ
    BACK -->|after delay| SQ
    REF --> SQ
